<title>USA: NYC Water Auth $361 mln repriced, 2026 yield cut.</title>
<headline>NYC Water Auth $361 mln repriced, 2026 yield cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said it repriced a New York City Municipal Water Finance Authority $361 million of water and sewer system revenue bond issue, Fiscal 1997 Series A, cutting the yield in 2026 to 5.801 percent from 5.85 percent.</p>
<p>NEW YORK CITY</p>
<p>RE: $361,330,000*</p>
